  "solution": {
    "text": "Total number of cells =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math><br />Total resistance =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>nr</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;cells provide a forward emf,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> cells provide a reverse emf so:<br />Total emf <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mtext>n</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mtext>E</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>E</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>ne</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>E</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>E</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mtext>n</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Current,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>total</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>emf</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>total</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>resistance</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>I</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>E</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mtext>n</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mtext>nr</mtext></mfenced></mfrac></math><br /><br />PD across A or B (voltage across internal resisitance)&nbsp;<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>V</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>Ir</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>E</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>E</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>n</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>/</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>nr</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>r</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>E</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&